  "formatVersion": 1,
  "id": "msm_examples:coordinates_bar_rules",
  "kind": "msm:rules",
  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "A rule book with one player rule and no blocks or items of its own. Every half second, for each player holding a vanilla compass in either hand, the text above the hotbar shows their X, Y and Z position (two decimals) and the time of day in ticks (0 is sunrise, 6000 noon, 18000 midnight). Readings mix with words in a text slot. The facing direction cannot be shown: Rules have no reading of where a player looks. Rules compile to a script, so this needs the Fabric mod jar export.",
